#ASSERT `s 121(1)(e) the person gives or offers a reward to a minister or an official for cooperation or influence` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING   -- element missing: in connection with the transaction of business with, or any matter of business relating to, the government / in connection with a claim against Her Majesty or any benefit that Her Majesty is authorized or is entitled to bestow / in connection with the appointment of any person, including themselves, to an office
#ASSERT `s 121(1)(e) the person gives or offers a reward to a minister or an official for cooperation or influence` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- alternative present: in connection with the transaction of business with, or any matter of business relating to, the government
#ASSERT `s 121(1)(e) the person gives or offers a reward to a minister or an official for cooperation or influence` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- alternative present: in connection with a claim against Her Majesty or any benefit that Her Majesty is authorized or is entitled to bestow
#ASSERT `s 121(1)(e) the person gives or offers a reward to a minister or an official for cooperation or influence` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- alternative present: in connection with the appointment of any person, including themselves, to an office

-- s 121(1)(f) the person having tendered for a government contract gives, offers, demands or accepts a reward for a tender's withdrawal: expected values follow the text (s 121(1)(f))
#ASSERT `s 121(1)(f) the person having tendered for a government contract gives, offers, demands or accepts a reward for a tender's withdrawal` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- every element of the provision present
#ASSERT `s 121(1)(f) the person having tendered for a government contract gives, offers, demands or accepts a reward for a tender's withdrawal` FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING   -- element missing: the person has made a tender to obtain a contract with the government
